{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"tool_calls","index":0,"message":{"content":"I need to parse this complex question carefully. Let me break it down:\n\n1. A book (Book A) was a contender for an award\n2. The award itself was originally created in the 2000s\n3. Book A was translated into over 25 languages\n4. In the 2010s, in the year Book A was published, another book (Book B) won that same award\n5. Book B had been released the preceding year\n6. The author of Book B was born in the same city where the author of Book A grew up\n7. Question: In what city was the author of Book A born?\n\nLet me start searching for clues about this award created in the 2000s.","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"literary award created founded 2000s translated twenty five languages\", \"international book award established 2000s contender translated over 25 languages\", \"book award founded 2000s prize translated many languages\"], \"top_k\": 8}","name":"search"},"id":"call_49e8f3835967408ba1105dc6","index":0,"type":"function"},{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"book translated into over 25 languages award contender 2010s\", \"novel translated 25 languages prize shortlist 2010s\"], \"top_k\": 8}","name":"search"},"id":"call_1367da83d13347f9a58c86ae","index":1,"type":"function"}]}}],"created":1789489969,"id":"chatcmpl-0b7f0a28-8e13-90c8-a1aa-f282ce0f1b05","model":"glm-5.2","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"prompt_tokens":3870,"completion_tokens":254,"reasoning_tokens":0,"total_tokens":4124,"cached_tokens":0,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0},"prompt_cost":0.000000,"completion_cost":0.000000,"cache_cost":0.000000}}